node_modules/
package-lock.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
screenshot.png

# Build and tool caches
dist/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/

# wrangler dev local state (workerd cache, local D1/KV/Hyperdrive shims)
.wrangler/

# The local capture archive. `FilesystemCaptureArchive` is a stand-in for bucket
# storage (section 8), and its default directory is `.captures` next to whatever
# started the runner — so a dev harvest drops raw provider JSON inside the repo.
# It is evidence, not source: too large to review, not ours to publish, and
# `biome check` reads it as an unformatted file until it is ignored here.
.captures/

# The hosted database's connection string. Deliberately NOT `DATABASE_URL` in
# `.env`: the Postgres tests truncate whatever `DATABASE_URL` names, so the hosted
# database is reachable only through `tools/with-hosted-env.sh`, which explains why.
.env.supabase

# The saved Overpass responses. `tools/load-osm.ts` writes every response here
# before parsing it, so a download is never paid for twice — see that file. Tens
# of megabytes of somebody else’s data: evidence, not source.
.osm/
